    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Modify \r\n\r\nThis Painter moves and paints down a winding avenue — but two things are missing.\r\n\r\n**Do This:** \r\n1. The Painter runs out of paint partway and stops right at a paint bucket. Add code so that whenever it's standing on a bucket, it picks up all the paint before continuing.\r\n2. Both `while` loops only check whether the Painter **can move** — add `has_paint()` to both conditions so the Painter stops as soon as either one becomes false. \r\n",
